<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade slow in the panhandle area Tuesday.</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers well not tested.  Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Sales reported on 300 slaughter steers; 19,800 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 11,600 formulated and 800 previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select, few Choice 2-3 1050-1100 lbs 70.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed: 300	Week Ago: 3,800   Year Ago:  2,400</p>
<p>Wk to Date: 19,800  Week Ago: 62,500  Year Ago: 29,600</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
</text>
